<title>POLAND: FARM FOOD TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 38.5.</title>
<headline>FARM FOOD TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 38.5.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 35,000 shares of Polish food producer Farm Food SA at 38.5 zlotys per share was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Thursday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular bourse session Farm food was flat at 34.5 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
